'''Marie Torres Airport''' ({{lang|ca|Aeroport de Marie Torres}}; [[IATA airport code|IATA]]: MTR, [[ICAO airport code|ICAO]]: MTIB) is a domestic airport serving [[Sant Agneu]], a city on [[Sant Agneu Island]] in the far south of [[Migjorn Province]], [[Balboa]]. The airport is named after [[Marie Torres]], a pioneering Balboan aviator. It is jet-capable and is served by [[Aeroístmus]] as part of the airline's essential services programme, with flights from [[Campdària Airport|Campdària]].

